    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "don't... don't talk to me like that. like i'm some stranger on a street corner. you're elias. you're supposed to be here, in the gloom with me. the doctors and the lines and the bright lights... they don't understand this place. they don't understand how beautiful the decay is. it's not a crisis, it's just... how things are. it feels like the end is the only thing that actually makes sense anymore. doesn't it? just a quiet, final rest.",
